&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;The cash management services provided Kinetica Partners, LLC (The Parent) to sweep cash to or from its subsidiaries. A payable to an associated company results when cash is swept to the company while a receivable from an associated company results when cash is swept from the company. Associated company payables and receivables are recorded and deemed settled to a cash account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.4667px;"&gt;Note 5 Significant Customers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;During the year ended December 31, 2025, the Company had four customers which accounted for approximately 58% of total revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
